        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average production\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards and the front cover (solid wood, 16 mm the basic structure and 19 mm the front covers). Screws and hinges are considered. The countertop is not included. Sink, cooker hood and waste system are included. The kitchen cupboards have an usable volume of 3.36 m3. The area of front cover is 8.9 m2. Linked to updated LCI of particle boards from Ecoinvent data v3.2 for KBOB recommendation 2016.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
